nasgorOS
========

nasgorOS is an Android distribution based on [LineageOS](https://lineageos.org).

Branch `17.0` is based on LineageOS `lineage-24.0` (Android 17).

Getting started
---------------

To initialize your local repository using the nasgorOS trees:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/nasgoros/android.git -b 17.0 --git-lfs
```

Add your device manifest, for example the Redmi Note 9 (merlinx):
```
mkdir -p .repo/local_manifests
cp .repo/manifests/local_manifests/merlinx.xml .repo/local_manifests/
```

Then sync up:
```
repo sync -c -j8 --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

Building
--------
```
source build/envsetup.sh
breakfast merlinx
mka nasgoros
```

The result is `out/target/product/merlinx/nasgorOS-<version>.zip`.

Credits
-------
nasgorOS is built on the work of the [LineageOS](https://github.com/LineageOS) project
and its device maintainers, and uses proprietary blobs from [TheMuppets](https://github.com/TheMuppets).
